      "color": "4",
      "text": "# Signal Generation\n\nAnalyzes market data using ML models (XGBoost/Platt calibration) to produce directional trading signals with confidence scores. Ingests OHLCV data, technical indicators, and feature-engineered inputs."
    },
    {
      "id": "c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "# Position Manager\n\nReceives validated signals and determines position sizing, risk limits, and portfolio allocation. Manages open positions, stop-losses, and take-profit targets based on current exposure and risk parameters."
    },
    {
      "id": "e5f6a7b8c9d0e1f2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1000,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "# Execution Engine\n\nTranslates position decisions into live exchange orders. Handles order routing, fill tracking, slippage management, and execution reporting. Interfaces directly with broker/exchange APIs."
    }
